[[:db/retract 17592186129499 :question/answer-fields 17592186126494] {:db/id 17592186129499 :question/problem "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}4({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij})\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}{a}_{ij}=40,\\,{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}{b}_{ij}=60.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The sum and constant multiple rules for double summations state that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{ij}, \\\\ {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}k{a}_{ij} & =k{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying these rules to the given sum, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}4({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & =4{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) \\\\  & =4{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}{a}_{ij}+4{\\sum }_{i=1}^{50}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{100}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 40+4\\cdot 60 \\\\  & =160+240 \\\\  & =400.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-82c98e1b-2b7a-5bde-9360-7f012814c1b0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-82c98e1b-2b7a-5bde-9360-7f012814c1b0" :answer-field/id #uuid "82c98e1b-2b7a-5bde-9360-7f012814c1b0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9d2b29b9-329a-5455-8348-aa7f4fcfe8f0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c78c8f9f-8af1-5372-9268-aae2ae1ac714" "answer-cc2b240a-91ea-5638-a32d-6d16bc129b5c" "answer-b40a38f1-fed4-5c13-82e8-1d517cf82331" "answer-9d2b29b9-329a-5455-8348-aa7f4fcfe8f0" "answer-a91e6846-0988-53c3-b781-324cbc6a73d2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c78c8f9f-8af1-5372-9268-aae2ae1ac714" :answer/id #uuid "c78c8f9f-8af1-5372-9268-aae2ae1ac714" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1\\,600" :db